<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/51/msa@/~cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "422 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \" Irregula- 422. Subject to the provisions contained in this rities not Chapter no finding, sentence or order passed to vitiate procee- or made by a Court of competent jurisdiction dings. shall be reversed or altered on account of— (a) any error, omission or irregularity in the complaint, sanction, consent, summons, warrant, charge, judgment or other proceedings before or during trial or in any inquiry or other proceedings under this Code; (b) the want of any sanction; or (c) the improper admission or rejection of any evidence, unless such error, omission, irregularity, want, or improper admission or rejection of evidence has occasioned a failure of justice.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/51/msa@> .
